# Images build with the repo root as context (compose, and `ADD .` in the langgraph build): keep the environment, the
# dataset, secrets and local notes out of it. Not `**/data`: apps/web/app/data is source. No `!` negations: they would
# put excluded files back.
.venv
**/.venv
data
**/data/gold_eval
**/*.parquet
**/*.duckdb
**/*.duckdb.wal
# spec 09: the held-out evaluation cases never enter an image (the langgraph build does `ADD .`)
eval/cases/heldout*
**/heldout*.jsonl
**/.env*
**/*.pem
.git
.claude
revision
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
# personal drafts and working notes, as in .gitignore
contexto_construccion.md
01_manual_claude_code_admin.md
docs_repo.zip
habilitar_bedrock.md
docs/sprint_final.md
docs/fichas_features.md
